      "title": "[MIP-21] MeridianReserve gas optimisation",
      "author": "kestrel.eth",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T14:03:11Z",
      "contentHash": "0xb9dc02a4ea65633c3f431cf8b57381d90bc6ed4920ef0ce0bdd796a98da6ea0d",
      "chunkCount": 9,
      "excerpt": "TL;DR: we upgrade MeridianReserve to a gas-optimised implementation (packed storage slots, unchecked loop counters). Deposits and withdrawals get ~1% cheaper. This is a pure gas optimisation: no change to ownership, permissions or treasury funds."
    },
    {
      "id": "MIP-21:pdf:0",
