      "contentHash": "0xb0ff28b9f88f91cf5c8d6d534e7adfe3f445e7d1ada4009026ac46b434c636c0",
      "chunkCount": 14,
      "excerpt": "3. Scope. The upgrade replaces the MeridianReserve implementation behind the existing UUPS proxy. Storage layout is preserved. The Timelock remains the sole owner of the Reserve."
    },
